              "content": "/* ==========================================================================\n   Barangay Complaint & Concern Reporting System\n   Mobile-first stylesheet. Everything is readable on a phone screen.\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------- design tokens */\n:root {\n  --green-900: #06251a;\n  --green-800: #0b3d2e;\n  --green-700: #11553e;\n  --green-600: #17694c;\n  --green-500: #1f8a63;\n  --green-100: #e6f4ee;\n  --green-050: #f2faf6;\n\n  --navy-900: #10233c;\n  --navy-700: #1c3557;\n  --navy-500: #2f4d7a;\n\n  --amber-600: #b45309;\n  --amber-500: #d97706;\n  --amber-100: #fef3c7;\n\n  --red-700: #b91c1c;\n  --red-600: #dc2626;\n  --red-100: #fee2e2;\n\n  --blue-600: #1d4ed8;\n  --blue-100: #dbeafe;\n\n  --gray-900: #101828;\n  --gray-700: #344054;\n  --gray-600: #475467;\n  --gray-500: #667085;\n  --gray-400: #98a2b3;\n  --gray-300: #d0d5dd;\n  --gray-200: #e4e7ec;\n  --gray-100: #f2f4f7;\n  --gray-050: #f9fafb;\n  --white: #ffffff;\n\n  --radius-sm: 8px;\n  --radius: 12px;\n  --radius-lg: 18px;\n  --radius-pill: 999px;\n\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(16, 35, 60, 0.06), 0 1px 3px rgba(16, 35, 60, 0.08);\n  --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(16, 35, 60, 0.07), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(16, 35, 60, 0.06);\n  --shadow-md: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(16, 35, 60, 0.10), 0 4px 6px -4px rgba(16, 35, 60, 0.08);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(16, 35, 60, 0.12), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(16, 35, 60, 0.08);\n\n  --font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\",\n          Arial, \"Noto Sans\", sans-serif;\n  --mono: \"SFMono-Regular\", Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", Menlo, monospace;\n\n  --header-h: 68px;\n  --container: 1180px;\n}\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ resets */\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nhtml { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; scroll-behav